  "build.SITE_DEFINITION": "one tensor per (node, start, SNV|INDEL) after indel left-normalization; INS and DEL at one start share an INDEL site; every allele is filtered on its own; passing alleles are listed in alleles[] by ALT count (ties: candidate order) as A1, A2, ...; every record covering any passing allele is a row, labeled with the allele it carries (or REF/OTHER), and channel 2 spells that allele over the site layout (longest insertion's slots + longest deletion's span); top-level counts/AF are A1's (the representative)",
